        overlap_ratios$ratio[overlap_ratios$spec == "mean_ratio"] * 100,
        overlap_ratios$ratio[overlap_ratios$spec == "min_ratio"] * 100,
        overlap_ratios$ratio[overlap_ratios$spec == "max_ratio"] * 100),
"  flat-85% assumption turns out close to the true mean, but the true rate varies year to year —",
"  a single constant understated that variation.",
"- **The bigger correction is to the maxima themselves, not the ratio**: the old placeholder's own",
"  approximate maxima were badly wrong for the earliest, previously worst-supported years:",
paste(apply(anchor_comp, 1, function(r)
  sprintf("  - %s: old £%s -> new £%s (%s%%)", r["year"],
          format(round(as.numeric(r["old"])), big.mark = ","),
          format(round(as.numeric(r["new"])), big.mark = ","), r["pct_change"])),
  collapse = "\n"),
